# wasm-pack writes `*` here to mark the artefact as build output.
# We override that — the pkg/ contents are committed to chromeless so
# the test fixture works without a Rust toolchain on the runner.
# Rebuild with:
#   cd <tf-multiverse>/portal/leptos-input-encoder-test-client
#   wasm-pack build --release --target web \
#     --out-dir <chromeless>/tests/webrtc/scenarios/portal-test-client/pkg
!*
